  -->
  <suppress>
    <notes>
      Not actionable: protobuf-kotlin 3.18.0 is embedded inside
      launcher-0.0.9-alpha02.jar, an Android test-tooling artifact managed by AGP.
      Not shipped in the production APK.  Our resolutionStrategy forces directly
      resolved protobuf-java to 3.25.5.  Re-evaluate when Google ships an updated
